title: SID History Injection
id: a1cdb71a-cfc8-4a17-82ff-0f0fdd125ad6
status: experimental
description: Detects modification of the sIDHistory attribute (event 5136), which attackers use to add a privileged group SID to an account so it inherits elevated access invisibly, a stealthy escalation and persistence technique.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1134/005/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 5136
    AttributeLDAPDisplayName: 'sIDHistory'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - ObjectName
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate domain migration tooling
level: high
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1134.005
